\u00f3n, retrasar la atrofia muscular y mantener\\/aumentar la flexibilidad.\",\"restrictions\":null,\"alarm_signs\":null,\"inmovilization\":null,\"pain_control\":null,\"mobility\":null,\"progression\":\"Disminuci\\u00f3n del dolor y aumento del ROM.\",\"physical_modalities\":\"Crioterapia. Compresa fr\\u00eda 8 min.\\r\\nTENS. 20 min, 10Hz \\u2013 20 Hz, 300us c\\/c\",\"exercises\":\"\\u2022\\tEjercicios Isom\\u00e9tricos (subm\\u00e1ximos). 3 series \\/ 8-10 reps\\r\\nRotaci\\u00f3n externa. \\r\\nRotaci\\u00f3n interna. \\r\\nB\\u00edceps. \\r\\n- Flexiones (pronaci\\u00f3n y supinaci\\u00f3n). \\r\\nDeltoides. (hombro)\\r\\n- Elevaciones frontales, laterales.\",\"activities\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"length\\\":0,\\\"prevObject\\\":{\\\"length\\\":0,\\\"prevObject\\\":{\\\"0\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"length\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\