estorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"length\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"selector\\\":\\\"#div_images_preview_image_resources > div\\\"},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1}}\",\"external_links\":null},{\"name\":\"Fase III: Fase de reforzamiento Intermedio\",\"goals\":\"Normalizar la movilidad, actividades normales asintom\\u00e1ticas y mejorar el rendimiento muscular.\",\"restrictions\":null,\"alarm_signs\":null,\"inmovilization\":null,\"pain_control\":null,\"mobility\":null,\"progression\":\"Disminuci\\u00f3n del dolor y\\/o s\\u00edntomas, Movilidad activa normal y mejor\\u00eda del reforzamiento muscular.\",\"physical_modalities\":\"15 min\\r\\nRusas 4 subida -2 bajada\\r\\nEMS 4 subida \\u2013 2 bajada\",\"exercises\":\"\\u2022Ejercicios de reforzamiento 4-5 series \\/ 10 reps\\r\\n1.\\tIniciar un programa de pesas con trabajo din\\u00e1mico \\r\\n-En dec\\u00fabito lateral posici\\u00f3n neutra de la extremidad realizar rotaciones internas y externas (acostado lateralmente)\\r\\n-En pronaci\\u00f3n realizar extensiones u abducciones en horizontal \\r\\n-En bipedestaci\\u00f3n Flexi\\u00f3n a 90\\u00b0 y trabajar el supraespinoso (De pie a 90 grados)\\r\\n2.\\tIniciar Ejercicios del musculo serrato\\r\\n-Ejercicios de plancha en la pared\\r\\n-Iniciar la progresi\\u00f3n a ejercicios con gomas el\\u00e1sticas en ligera abducci\\u00f3n (Para el reforzamiento de la rotaci\\u00f3n interna y de la rotaci\\u00f3n externa)\\r\\n-Iniciar la ergometr\\u00eda de brazo (para resistencia)\",\"activities\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"length\\\":0,\\\"prevObject\\\":{\\\"length\\\":0,\\\"prevObject\\\":{\\\"0\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"length\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"selector\\\":\\\"#div_images_preview_image_resources > div\\\"},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1}}\",\"external_links\":null},{\"name\":\"Fase IV Fase de reforzamiento avanzado din\\u00e1mico\",\"goals\":\"Aumentar la fuerza y resistencia, Aumentar la potencia y aumentar el control neuromuscular.\",\"restrictions\":null,\"alarm_signs\":null,\"inmovilization\":null,\"pain_control\":null,\"mobility\":null,\"progression\":\"Movilidad completa y no dolorosa, ausencia de dolor espontaneo o a la palpaci\\u00f3n y fuerza del 70% de  la contralateral.\",\"physical_modalities\":\"15 min\\r\\nRusas 5 subida - 1 bajada\\r\\nEMS 5 subida \\u2013 1 bajada\",\"exercises\":\"\\u2022Ejercicios 4-5 series \\/ 10 reps\\r\\nLanzamiento de pelota \\/ balon medicinal incrementando el peso progresivamente \\r\\nABD, AD, Elevaci\\u00f3n frontal de hombro con ligas de resistencia \\r\\n\\r\\n*Se recomienda en esta fase realizar una prueba isocin\\u00e9tica, rotaci\\u00f3n interna y rotaciones externas, ABD y AD*\",\"activities\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"length\\\":0,\\\"prevObject\\\":{\\\"length\\\":0,\\\"prevObject\\\":{\\\"0\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"length\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"selector\\\":\\\"#div_images_preview_image_resources > div\\\"},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1}}\",\"external_links\":null},{\"name\":\"Fase V: Retorno a la fase de actividad\",\"goals\":\"Actividad sin restricciones y asintom\\u00e1tica.\",\"restrictions\":null,\"alarm_signs\":null,\"inmovilization\":null,\"pain_control\":null,\"mobility\":null,\"progression\":\"Movilidad completa y no dolorosa, ausencia de dolor espontaneo o a la palpaci\\u00f3n, criterios de la prueba isocin\\u00e9tico y una exploraci\\u00f3n cl\\u00ednica satisfactoria.\",\"physical_modalities\":null,\"exercises\":\"\\u2022Programa de ejercicios de mantenimiento 4-5 series 12-15 reps\\r\\n-Ejercicios de flexibilidad\\r\\nBarra en L, flexi\\u00f3n, rotaci\\u00f3n externa y autoestiramientos capsulares.\\r\\n-Ejercicios isot\\u00f3nicos\\r\\nSupraespinoso, extensi\\u00f3n en pronaci\\u00f3n y abducci\\u00f3n horizontal en pronaci\\u00f3n \\r\\n-Ejercicios con gomas el\\u00e1sticas \\r\\nRotaci\\u00f3n interna y externa\",\"activities\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"length\\\":0,\\\"prevObject\\\":{\\\"length\\\":0,\\\"prevObject\\\":{\\\"0\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"length\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1},\\\"selector\\\":\\\"#div_images_preview_image_resources > div\\\"},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/create\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery1910771937389071947\\\":1}}\",\"external_links\":null}]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,265,0,NULL),(60,'Post quirúrgica de fractura de tibia y peroné','Una fractura de tibia y peroné puede ocurrir en un solo hueso o en los dos. El motivo de dicha fracturaes debido a un impacto directo sobre la pierna, como puede ocurrir en el fútbol o una caída. En cualquier caso, no tiene porque ser necesario un golpe violento para que se produzca la fractura ósea, puede ser suficiente un pequeño choque o un movimiento incorrecto. Una repetición de contracciones de los músculos de la pierna puede ser suficiente para provocar una fractura por estrés.','2022-09-23 10:50:18','2022-09-23 11:04:16','{\"fases\":[{\"name\":\"Primera fase\",\"goals\":\"Objetivos de las sesiones Acelerar el proceso de cicatrizaci\\u00f3n de quir\\u00fargica Fortalecer musculatura alrededor de cirug\\u00eda (cu\\u00e1driceps, isquiotibiales, musculo de cadera, tronco) Preparar para la marcha musculatura del tronco, pierna contraria no operada y brazos, enfoc\\u00e1ndose en el tronco y pierna contraria.\",\"restrictions\":\"Evitar doblar la rodilla bruscamente, recordar que no puede apoyar pierna todav\\u00eda por lo que ning\\u00fan ejercicio debe de cargar peso con la pierna afectada.\",\"alarm_signs\":\"Precauciones Osteoporosis posiblemente avanzada (riesgo de fractura si el ejercicio es muy fuerte) Cadera afectada Lesiones en columna Cicatrizaci\\u00f3n retrograda y la diabetes que presenta.\",\"inmovilization\":null,\"pain_control\":null,\"mobility\":null,\"progression\":null,\"physical_modalities\":\"Plan de terapia Colocar interferenciales 1 -100 para consolidaci\\u00f3n \\u00f3sea 10 min Ultrasonido de baja intensidad para cicatrizaci\\u00f3n y consolidaci\\u00f3n \\u00f3sea 5 minutos Colocar rusas en cu\\u00e1driceps para potenciar fortalecimiento tratando que suba lo mas que tolere\",\"exercises\":\"Puente con solo apoyando pierna izquierda 2 series de 5 repeticiones Dejarse caer hacia atr\\u00e1s luego regresar sola como abdominales incompletos 3 series de 10 repeticiones Con resistencia detener el movimiento de la pierna de aducci\\u00f3n, abducci\\u00f3n, flexi\\u00f3n y extensi\\u00f3n o empuje al terapeuta 5 sesiones de 10 repeticiones. se puede usar liga de resistencia Rotaciones de cama Ejercicios con brazos para fortalecer con pesas 3 series de 10 repeticiones\",\"activities\":null,\"images\":\"{\\\"length\\\":0,\\\"prevObject\\\":{\\\"length\\\":0,\\\"prevObject\\\":{\\\"0\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/60\\/edit\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/60\\/edit\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery19105743545822609277\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/60\\/edit\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/60\\/edit\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery19105743545822609277\\\":1},\\\"length\\\":1},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/60\\/edit\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/60\\/edit\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery19105743545822609277\\\":1},\\\"selector\\\":\\\"#div_images_preview_image_resources > div\\\"},\\\"context\\\":{\\\"location\\\":{\\\"ancestorOrigins\\\":{},\\\"href\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\/terapeutic_plan\\/60\\/edit\\\",\\\"origin\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"https:\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"hostname\\\":\\\"www.recuperatfisioterapia.com\\\",\\\"port\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pathname\\\":\\\"\\/terapeutic_plan\\/60\\/edit\\\",\\\"search\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"hash\\\":\\\"\\\"},\\\"jQuery19105743545822609277\\\":1}}\",\"external_links\":null}]}',NULL,'3','1','ACC','ACC',268,0,NULL),(61,'Fractura de la Cúpula Radial','La fractura de cúpula radial o mejor conocida como fractura de la cabeza del radio, se puede definir cómo un “estabilizador asociado multifunción” del codo ya que es la parte proximal del radio y es fundamental para la articulación del codo, ya que forma la parte ósea de su zona lateral.  Y participa en los movimientos de extensión, flexión y prono-supinación','2022-12-03 12:28:47','2022-12-05 15:13:48','[]',NULL,NULL,'1','Maria Rocio Elizabeth Mendoza Gómez','Marisela Alegría Ruiz',309,0,NULL);
