 le emite diagnostico. No acude al masaje agendado, no se puede contactar al numero falso que dejo. Se cierra caso el 31 de mayo 2022.','physiotherapy_valoration_subjective',NULL,187,'2022-05-31 11:21:40','2022-05-31 11:21:40',NULL,2),(14660,'Objetivo',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_objective',NULL,187,'2022-05-31 11:21:40','2022-05-31 11:21:40',NULL,2),(14661,'Analisis',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_anlysis',NULL,187,'2022-05-31 11:21:40','2022-05-31 11:21:40',NULL,2),(14662,'Planes',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_plans',NULL,187,'2022-05-31 11:21:40','2022-05-31 11:21:40',NULL,2),(14663,'T/A',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_vs_ta',NULL,187,'2022-05-31 11:21:40','2022-05-31 11:21:40',NULL,2),(14664,'TEMP',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_temperature',NULL,187,'2022-05-31 11:21:40','2022-05-31 11:21:40',NULL,2),(14665,'FCA',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_fca',NULL,187,'2022-05-31 11:21:40','2022-05-31 11:21:40',NULL,2),(14666,'FRE',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_fre',NULL,187,'2022-05-31 11:21:40','2022-05-31 11:21:40',NULL,2),(14667,'Subjetivo',NULL,'Paciente que toma consulta para una lesión de codo de tenista o epicondilitis.  Al final solo toma la sesión de consulta no agenda sesiones preescritas. Alta el 31 de mayo 2022','physiotherapy_valoration_subjective',NULL,43,'2022-05-31 12:14:22','2022-05-31 12:14:22',NULL,2),(14668,'Objetivo',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_objective',NULL,43,'2022-05-31 12:14:22','2022-05-31 12:14:22',NULL,2),(14669,'Analisis',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_anlysis',NULL,43,'2022-05-31 12:14:22','2022-05-31 12:14:22',NULL,2),(14670,'Planes',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_plans',NULL,43,'2022-05-31 12:14:22','2022-05-31 12:14:22',NULL,2),(14671,'T/A',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_vs_ta',NULL,43,'2022-05-31 12:14:22','2022-05-31 12:14:22',NULL,2),(14672,'TEMP',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valoration_temperature',NULL,43,'2022-05-31 12:14:22','2022-05-31 12:14:22',NULL,2),(14673,'FCA',NULL,'','physiotherapy_valor